        <mxCell id="legendtxt" value="1. Upload .onnx + .json&#10;2. S3 ObjectCreated event&#10;3. StartExecution&#10;4. RunInstances / TerminateInstances&#10;5. SendCommand&#10;6. Run dxcom compile (via SSM agent)&#10;7. Download model / upload .dxnn&#10;&#10;A. Publish component version (idempotent)&#10;B. Included in deployment&#10;C. Targets thing group&#10;D. Deploys com.deepx.dx-runtime&#10;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;(IoT jobs over MQTT/TLS)&#10;E. Device downloads driver / firmware /&#10;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;dx_rt / dx_stream (public HTTPS)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1B660F;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="legendbox">
